WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:09.240
<i>I stretched out my scratch-covered arms
with all my might</i>

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.720
<i>I-it can't be!</i>

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:05.960
<i>You're!</i>

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:17.410
<i>to try to obtain it all</i>

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:33.430
<i>I shut my eyes to crush
the slight amount of pain</i>

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:24.230
<i>Hey! Get back here!</i>

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:25.130
<i>B-Bro!</i>

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:26.620
<i>B-Brother!</i>

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:28.610
<i>Retreat for now!</i>

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:30.470
<i>Oh, no, you don't!</i>

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:32.580
<i>Was that...</i>

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:38.610
<i>that remains in the depths
of my dried-up heart...</i>

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.240
<i>Damn!</i>

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:51.880
<i>...together with a
slightly too old memory</i>

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:44.260
<i>Ow...</i>

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.100
<i>Taiko-chan! Behind you!</i>

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:55.550
<i>Could well be the precursor</i>

00:00:53.380 --> 00:01:01.320
<i>As everything retreats into the distance
it all seems blurry,</i>

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:57.650
<i>to something terrible about to happen!</i>

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:02.280
<i>I'm hungry...</i>

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>an unnaturally-warped landscape</i>

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:17.440
<i>As I strive yet once more
for that unfulfilled dream</i>

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:25.610
<i>a wavering mirage lies
ahead of the birds' path</i>

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:29.990
