00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:37.630
<i>Taiko-chan!</i>

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:40.590
<i>What?!</i>

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:46.120
<i>Master...</i>

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:52.640
Listen, Kosuna!

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:55.680
The situation you're currently placed in!

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:58.200
The strength difference
between you and your enemy!

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:01.770
What you can do and what you must do!

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:04.350
Assess it all instantly!

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:07.610
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.790
<i>The situation I'm in!</i>

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:16.930
<i>The strength difference between me...
and my enemy!</i>

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:19.290
<i>Crap!</i>

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:23.150
<i>Y-you did it!</i>

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:27.620
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:32.090
<i>This is all I can do!</i>

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:35.080
<i>I'm going to look for Natsuko-san now!</i>

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:36.880
<i>So the rest is all yours!</i>

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:38.680
<i>A-all ours?</i>

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:43.310
<i>She's the Sunabouzu's pupil, all right.
So we're decoys, huh?</i>

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:47.200
<i>Alright! Akio! Haruo!</i>

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:51.660
<i>It's time to show 'em what the
Machine Gun Brothers are made of!</i>

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:52.630
<i>- Yeah!
- Yeah!</i>

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:15.960
<i>Sergeant Kawaguchi?</i>

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.290
<i>Guildhead!</i>

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:18.690
<i>What is this?</i>

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:20.710
<i>W-we're too late...</i>

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:25.870
<i>The key sections of the facility
have been completely destroyed!</i>

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.010
<i>We're done for!</i>

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:33.670
<i>The collateral explosions
activated the Dark Age... keepsake...</i>

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:34.540
<i>Keepsake?</i>

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.180
<i>A super-tectonic weapon.</i>

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:40.310
<i>The demonic invention responsible
for this enormous crater.</i>

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.460
<i>Then that light in the sky was...</i>

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.850
<i>An omen before its activation!</i>

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.870
<i>Then we have to escape!</i>

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:48.050
<i>Yes, but...</i>

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:52.550
<i>Pathetic! Just pathetic!
This is not my only laboratory!</i>

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:56.810
<i>But the intruders
must be properly punished!</i>

00:03:57.030 --> 00:03:58.950
<i>Guildhead! What on earth are you...</i>

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:00.660
<i>Isn't it obvious?</i>

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:05.880
<i>I'm speeding up the weapon's activation
and slaughtering them all!</i>

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:10.170
<i>Please stop, Guildhead!
That'll kill us too!</i>

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:13.650
<i>An escape route has been secured.
Don't fret.</i>

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:14.520
<i>But!</i>

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.240
<i>Be quiet.</i>

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:25.670
<i>Kaizuka-san?</i>

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:32.010
<i>Little shits think they can
stomp all over my lofty goal!</i>

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:34.590
<i>They'll pay! They'll pay!</i>

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:41.200
So the old crackpot's nice-guy mask
has finally come off...

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.010
<i>You came, boy!</i>

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:49.030
Yeah.

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.280
<i>Matsunami-san...</i>

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:33.980
<i>W-we can't hold it off anymore!</i>

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:35.750
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:40.040
<i>I don't like it, but looks like
we gotta copy that bastard!</i>

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.120
<i>Copy? You don't mean!</i>

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:49.640
<i>Where... am I?</i>

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:03.180
<i>Crawling all over the place!
Just like a cute little piggy!</i>

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:04.300
<i>When did you...</i>

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:10.580
<i>Not bad!</i>

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:17.070
<i>I don't got time to play
with big-busted broads like you!</i>

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:19.280
<i>After I went through
the trouble of chasing you?!</i>

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:21.230
<i>That's not very nice, Flatty!</i>

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:26.170
<i>Finally giving in, huh?</i>

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:31.640
<i>Howdya like this?!</i>

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:36.980
<i>It can't be!</i>

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.530
<i>Yep! It sure is!</i>

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:45.780
<i>The same attack the
Sunabouzu used back then!</i>

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:47.450
<i>W-what?!</i>

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:50.280
<i>- Yes!
- Yes!
- Yes!</i>

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:57.710
<i>Too bad!</i>

00:06:58.420 --> 00:07:01.990
<i>Looks like you're still
no match at all for me!</i>

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:06.620
<i>Which means that the Great Kanto Desert's
most skilled babe...</i>

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:09.140
<i>...is me!</i>

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:20.200
<i>Now die.</i>

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.780
<i>H-hey! Who the hell?!</i>

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:30.260
<i>Say hello to Amagumo!</i>

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:31.600
<i>Amagumo?!</i>

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:35.510
<i>Yes. Also known as
the "Repo-Man of Souls".</i>

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:40.050
<i>You're already in my threaded web...</i>

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:42.530
<i>There is no escape from it...</i>

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:45.110
<i>Hey! Taiko-chan!</i>

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.410
<i>Where are you?!</i>

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:50.730
<i>Oh, geez. The Kong got beaten? Sheesh!</i>

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:53.900
<i>- Don't move!
- No can do.</i>

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:56.300
<i>F-fool! I said don't move!</i>

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:57.920
<i>I can't die here!</i>

00:07:58.280 --> 00:07:58.940
<i>Look out!</i>

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.410
<i>Looks like you've matured a little...</i>

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:22.200
<i>S-shut up! This isn't-</i>

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:24.810
<i>Do you want to see him?</i>

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:26.550
<i>Go.</i>

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:27.950
<i>B-but!</i>

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:30.620
<i>I said go, damn it!</i>

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:39.380
<i>As if this busty broad...
would ever die... from your bullets!</i>

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:46.530
<i>H-h-hey! W-what do I...</i>

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:06.350
<i>That lousy flatty.
There'll be no next time, though!</i>

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:11.200
<i>My shoulders are stiff! That's what
I get for being out of practice!</i>

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:13.460
<i>Kan-chan! Sorry!</i>

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:22.560
<i>Those eyes haven't changed at all.
With that cold glare...</i>

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:25.550
<i>They're just like mine
when I was young...</i>

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:28.910
Hearin' that doesn't make me any happier.

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:30.610
<i>Such a rude mouth...</i>

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.380
Sorry, Kaizuka-san.

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:34.250
But now you die.

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:35.490
<i>What?!</i>

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:38.590
<i>And why is that?</i>

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:40.890
Because you're a huge liar.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:44.430
You say it's for the
sake of the desert people...

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:49.220
But you just want full reign
over the desert for yourself, dontcha?

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:55.090
<i>T-that's not true! He truly does
care for the future of the people!</i>

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:57.950
<i>Yeah! Unlike you!</i>

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.970
I said don't move.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:05.400
He said it himself. He's the
only one he gives a damn about.

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:07.180
<i>So, then...</i>

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:10.280
<i>What will you do once you kill me?</i>

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:12.420
Dunno. What will I do?

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:15.220
<i>Going to make a
Boob Kingdom or something?</i>

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:21.870
<i>Mizuno Kanta!</i>

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:25.880
<i>It looks like leaving you alive
was a mistake after all!</i>

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:26.930
Give it up.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:30.850
<i>It's true that Kaizuka-san
might only care about himself!</i>

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:32.490
<i>Sergeant Kawaguchi?!</i>

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:33.300
<i>But!</i>

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:36.690
<i>He's hundreds of times better
than you and your disregard</i>

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:38.090
<i>for the unfortunate people around you!</i>

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:46.010
Can't believe you fell
for such an old trick!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:49.770
Not even Kosuna falls for it anymore!

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:51.570
Hey.

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:55.200
<i>Human as you are,
do not waste your life.</i>

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:56.730
<i>When did he...</i>

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:58.000
<i>An invisibility suit!</i>

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:01.040
Now, then. Let's end this circus.

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:03.000
<i>You'll all die, too.</i>

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:05.610
Nah, not me.

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:07.380
<i>Then give it a shot.</i>

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:08.470
Sure!

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:10.920
<i>Natsuko!</i>

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:12.100
<i>Where are you?!</i>

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:14.870
<i>There she is!</i>

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:16.020
<i>Guys!</i>

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:18.190
<i>Freakin' Kanta's here, too!</i>

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:20.180
<i>Doesn't matter! Just shoot!</i>

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:24.470
Damn Junko screwed up!

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:25.800
<i>There's no escape!</i>

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:28.200
Hey, Samesuga! Back me up!

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:29.310
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:42.300
<i>Master!</i>

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:50.930
<i>Well, I guess guns don't work...</i>

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:57.120
<i>You alright, Natsuko?!</i>

00:11:57.520 --> 00:12:01.120
<i>I'm fine! But there's no time!
We have to escape!</i>

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:01.960
<i>- Right!
- Right!</i>

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:10.040
<i>Master...</i>

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:43.780
<i>It's all clear!</i>

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:46.670
<i>Alright! Let's haul ass before it blows!</i>

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.950
So everyone's finally here.

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:06.210
<i>Master...</i>

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.750
<i>Master!</i>

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:11.370
Yo.

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:13.070
<i>I finally...</i>

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:18.850
<i>It's those ones from...</i>

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:20.220
<i>Shit!</i>

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:21.310
<i>B-Brother!</i>

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:24.380
This time, they ain't balloons.

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:26.770
<i>Kanta! You bastard!</i>

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:30.070
<i>This is the best you can do?</i>

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:31.490
<i>You game?!</i>

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:34.230
<i>We're screwed as it is! Let's do it!</i>

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:35.160
<i>W-wait!</i>

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:45.440
<i>What about him?!</i>

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.800
<i>They're all yours!</i>

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:53.860
Forget him. He's just a small-fry.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:00.700
<i>Master...</i>

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:05.480
<i>You were captured? You see, I...</i>

00:14:06.350 --> 00:14:10.700
<i>I always felt I owed you my life,</i>

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:15.980
<i>and I figured you made yourself
a decoy then so we could escape...</i>

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:19.990
<i>I wanted to ask you so much
if I ever saw you again...</i>

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:21.790
<i>I still screw up jobs all the time...</i>

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:25.080
<i>I should've just done what you
taught me when I was with you,</i>

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:27.720
<i>but it's hard to act
and think on my own, so...</i>

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:28.840
Not quite.

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:34.740
My plan to use you as a decoy
to escape didn't work out so well...

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:39.810
Though I did manage to get to
my current position 'cause of that.

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:44.780
I... decided to work for this side.

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:50.330
<i>So you sold us out
to suck up to the enemy.</i>

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:51.740
<i>The war?</i>

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:53.770
I'm sure you've sensed it.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:55.810
A struggle's going on at the border.

00:14:56.090 --> 00:14:58.140
RHG or factionist army or whatever,

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:01.800
this is no time to get mixed up
with a bunch of nobodies.

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:07.050
<i>So you're using the merit of my disposal
to rise up the military ranks.</i>

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:11.460
It's a war. Anything is possible.

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:19.510
<i>You're using this crisis to
hijack the Oasis, aren't you?</i>

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:22.590
Yeah...

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:30.320
<i>Taiko-san...</i>

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:42.810
<i>I'm sorry for
involving you all in this!</i>

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.290
<i>Idiot! Don't apologize!</i>

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:48.280
<i>Yeah! We're happy
we could fight with you!</i>

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.420
<i>We're with you all the way,
even in Hell!</i>

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:51.910
<i>Guys!</i>

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:53.710
Taiko.

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:55.270
<i>Yes?!</i>

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:58.030
It's still not too late
for you to join me.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:02.010
It does look like
you're somewhat useful now...

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:12.450
It's a war! You can use this
chance to become anything at all!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:16.520
Even the Kanto's most skilled chick...

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:22.570
<i>Master.</i>

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:29.190
<i>Was it you who had
Matsunami-san's shop set on fire?</i>

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:38.630
Oh. That?

00:16:44.410 --> 00:16:48.700
I couldn't have word I was alive
get out and people track me down...

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:58.270
What I did to Matsunami-san was horrible.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.280
<i>What are you doing?!</i>

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.970
<i>You still haven't disposed of Kaizuka!</i>

00:17:10.260 --> 00:17:10.980
<i>Mitsuru!</i>

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:12.500
Yeah, alright.

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:13.580
<i>You good-for-nothing!</i>

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:16.660
<i>Quit your damn sleepin'
and do your Hulkosis!</i>

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:18.550
<i>- Don't move!
- Garbage! Scum!</i>

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:28.680
<i>You bastard. I'm gonna
kick your ass again!</i>

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:32.800
Taiko! You...

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:34.520
Where's your winch?!

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:46.170
He still hasn't gotten over it?!

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:47.730
<i>H-Huron!</i>

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:49.460
<i>Now!</i>

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:53.220
Taiko! You...

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:55.990
<i>Matsunami Customs can
be used this way, too!</i>

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:13.350
Taiko! You used the winch
as a detonator?!

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:15.160
<i>What do you think?!</i>

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.320
<i>Let's scram while we can!</i>

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.120
<i>B-but how?!</i>

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:22.550
<i>We're toast if we don't hurry!</i>

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:29.850
<i>Here comes Savior of the
Great Kanto Desert, Amagumo!</i>

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:32.490
<i>Now!</i>

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:34.540
<i>Let's haul ass, bastards!</i>

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:38.020
<i>- Y-yeah...
- Y-yeah...
- Y-yeah...</i>

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.760
<i>Get the hell in!</i>

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:50.820
Damn! They prepared a countermeasure!

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:55.040
But I can't tell if these guys
are useful or useless...

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:55.730
<i>Master!</i>

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:15.800
<i>I'm... not going with you.</i>

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:20.460
Then we're enemies from now on.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:33.320
<i>Y-you're... a girl?!</i>

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:34.160
<i>Who're you?!</i>

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:36.550
<i>I saved the Sunabouzu!</i>

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:39.530
<i>I beg you! Please make me your pupil!</i>

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:42.170
<i>Being a handyman is a hardcore job!</i>

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:44.470
<i>Moron! Why'd you shoot?!</i>

00:19:44.470 --> 00:19:45.620
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:49.040
<i>Master! Let's quit! We'll be cursed!</i>

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:52.210
<i>I don't want this! I want a Magnum!</i>

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:55.900
<i>I'd just be a burden on my master.</i>

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:56.870
<i>Damn kid!</i>

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:58.700
<i>Master!</i>

00:19:58.700 --> 00:19:59.690
<i>Master!</i>

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:00.500
<i>Master...</i>

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:07.090
<i>Master! Master! Master! Master!</i>

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.080
<i>Let's scram, Mitsuru!</i>

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:17.520
<i>The other part of me says I'm stupid.</i>

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:21.220
<i>That it'd be much better
to go with my master.</i>

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:25.630
<i>It's no real surprise
that he betrayed us...</i>

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:31.040
<i>Plus, he always used to belittle me,
but he says I'm useful now!</i>

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:34.080
<i>But if I go with him,</i>

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:37.310
<i>I'll just be the same goldfish dung
I was half a year ago.</i>

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:43.500
<i>I'll never be the Great Kanto Desert's
most skilled beauty like that!</i>

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:57.880
Let's get goin'.

00:20:57.880 --> 00:20:58.810
<i>It is time.</i>

00:20:58.810 --> 00:20:59.400
Eh?!

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:02.290
<i>It was then it happened.</i>

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:11.740
<i>It's said to have lit up the Great
Kanto Desert like the afternoon sun...</i>

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:31.030
<i>I, I'm the one - with the scorching sun</i>

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:30.500
<i>The Great Kanto Desert.</i>

00:21:31.150 --> 00:21:34.020
<i>The temperature exceeds 50º
Celsius in the afternoon,</i>

00:21:31.150 --> 00:21:35.000
<i>Up to me...</i>

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:37.300
<i>and plummets below freezing at night.</i>

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:38.450
<i>At night comes a freezing isolation</i>

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:40.750
<i>Here lied the ruins of a
civilization whose transgressions</i>

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:40.400
<i>Don't be soft...</i>

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:46.600
<i>slipping through the eye of the needle</i>

00:21:40.750 --> 00:21:43.230
<i>brought about its downfall
centuries prior.</i>

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:47.680
<i>One could even say they were
grave-posts for those who died here.</i>

00:21:48.920 --> 00:21:54.010
<i>In this hellish desert, man,
the most violent and powerful creature</i>

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:51.840
<i>You'll lose your life</i>

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:56.780
<i>Let do it... Ah, angel.</i>

00:21:54.670 --> 00:21:57.480
<i>in the history of the earth...</i>

00:21:56.780 --> 00:22:01.780
<i>Now is the time for you to smile</i>

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:08.650
<i>Vanishing history, a dissipated victory...
that's just Destiny</i>

00:22:08.650 --> 00:22:19.100
<i>I can definitely hear it,
the sound of the wind</i>

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:22.130
<i>and a dry drum-like heartbeat</i>

00:22:22.130 --> 00:22:25.730
<i>Living is my Mission</i>

00:22:50.490 --> 00:22:59.350
<i>Let do it... Ah, angel!
Now is the time to stand up and be strong</i>

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:58.130
<i>Yo! "Come" again!</i>

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:03.480
<i>A sad History, a hidden Victory,</i>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:05.990
<i>that's the Destiny</i>

00:23:05.990 --> 00:23:16.490
<i>...continued to thrive, bursting with
as much avarice as ever it did.</i>

00:23:06.740 --> 00:23:10.370
<i>Let do it... Ah, angel!</i>

00:23:10.370 --> 00:23:15.030
<i>Now is the time for you to smile</i>

00:23:15.030 --> 00:23:19.230
<i>Vanishing history, a dissipated victory.</i>

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:22.120
<i>That's just Destiny</i>

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:30.970
<i>There's nothing certain
about what tomorrow holds</i>

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:39.080
<i>so living through this minute
is my mission alone</i>
